Hi, just to post the solution in my case: it was a really silly mistake of me, as I had put the command to read the time periods BEFORE loading the file with the time periods:

BioGeoBEARS_run_object = readfiles_BioGeoBEARS_run(BioGeoBEARS_run_object)
BioGeoBEARS_run_object$timesfn = time_stratified_fn

instead of

BioGeoBEARS_run_object$timesfn = time_stratified_fn
BioGeoBEARS_run_object = readfiles_BioGeoBEARS_run(BioGeoBEARS_run_object)

Thanks for the input anyway!
Best,
Ivan

